{"4387000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Antarctic Grave", "steam_appid": 4387000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive at Any Cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antarctic Grave</strong> is an atmospheric first-person survival horror where survival depends not on firepower, but on how well you use your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an isolated Antarctic research station, manage electricity, avoid deadly creatures, and uncover the mystery of a catastrophe buried beneath the ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/56b37878197b66209733a2f6dbd7544f.poster.avif?t=1781819259\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/56b37878197b66209733a2f6dbd7544f.webm?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/56b37878197b66209733a2f6dbd7544f.mp4?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player campaign (~2–2.5 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management to control electricity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grotesque mutants and a constant stalking threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical survival instead of nonstop action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/77e6f299b331f25d489dee1ec12ba3de.poster.avif?t=1781819259\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/77e6f299b331f25d489dee1ec12ba3de.webm?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/77e6f299b331f25d489dee1ec12ba3de.mp4?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Electricity as a Survival Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station’s operation depends on a generator. Maintain fuel supplies to power lights, unlock new areas, and alter enemy behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuel is more than just a power source — it can destroy obstacles, create traps, or be used for powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/9ec9b2877533169efb86661ab231e6e4.poster.avif?t=1781819259\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/9ec9b2877533169efb86661ab231e6e4.webm?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/9ec9b2877533169efb86661ab231e6e4.mp4?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Constant Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station has been overrun by grotesque mutants — the result of an alien infection using ancient fossils as biological material. Each enemy requires its own survival strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through exploration:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes and audio logs reveal the station’s past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues with survivors influence access to resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player decisions shape how the story is perceived</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices determine the ending</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game does not hold your hand — you must piece together the truth yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/b9decbc801b857e1abbb888b790f1a35.poster.avif?t=1781819259\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/b9decbc801b857e1abbb888b790f1a35.webm?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/b9decbc801b857e1abbb888b790f1a35.mp4?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive at Any Cost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antarctic Grave</strong> is an atmospheric first-person survival horror where survival depends not on firepower, but on how well you use your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an isolated Antarctic research station, manage electricity, avoid deadly creatures, and uncover the mystery of a catastrophe buried beneath the ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/56b37878197b66209733a2f6dbd7544f.poster.avif?t=1781819259\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4387000/extras/56b37878197b66209733a2f6dbd7544f.webm?t=1781819259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste